OL,3,GNEWSAAppeal for 100 cards for special
OL,4,Acentenarian
OL,5,
OL,6,FA care home for the elderly in East
OL,7,FCambridgeshire is appealing for 100
OL,8,Fbirthday cards to be sent to its oldest
OL,9,Fresident who turns 100 later this
OL,10,Fmonth.
OL,12,FWaterhouse Manor care home in Fordham
OL,13,Fnear Soham wants to mark the birthday
OL,14,Fof Reynolds Bowen (known as Ren), who
OL,15,Fwas born and raised in the village and
OL,16,Fhas lived there his whole life.
OL,18,FBowen is a widower with no children. He
OL,19,Fhas only two surviving relatives and is
OL,20,Fthe great-great-grandson of noted rural
OL,21,Fpoet James Withers, who died in 1892.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,375,370,200,160,0,100
